  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution of the Ministry of Finance to the IMF&apos;s Ukraine Capacity Development Fund</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Pr&#xED;spevok Ministerstva financi&#xED; SR do &quot;Ukraine Capacity Development&quot; MMF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;In the context of Ukraine&apos;s post-war recovery and reform efforts, the IMF approved a 4-year financial support program for Ukraine through the Extended Fund Facility (EFF). It includes an extensive capacity building program &quot;Ukraine Capacity Development Fund&quot;, adapted to Ukraine&apos;s absorption capabilities and limitations related to the ongoing conflict. The goal is to support Ukraine through measures in the area of &#x200B;&#x200B;macroeconomic and financial stability, and structural reforms in the management of public finances, including anti-corruption.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;V kontexte povojnovej obnovy a reformn&#xFD;ch sn&#xE1;h Ukrajiny schv&#xE1;lil MMF 4-ro&#x10D;n&#xFD; program finan&#x10D;nej podpory Ukrajine prostredn&#xED;ctvom Extended Fund Facility (EFF). Jeho s&#xFA;&#x10D;as&#x165;ou je rozsiahly program budovania odborn&#xFD;ch kapac&#xED;t &#x201E;Ukraine Capacity Development Fund&#x201C;, prisp&#xF4;soben&#xFD; absorp&#x10D;n&#xFD;m mo&#x17E;nostiam Ukrajiny a obmedzeniam s&#xFA;visiacim s prebiehaj&#xFA;cim konfliktom. Cie&#x13E;om je podpora Ukrajiny prostredn&#xED;ctvom opatren&#xED; v oblasti makroekonomickej a finan&#x10D;nej stability, a &#x161;truktur&#xE1;lnych reforiem v riaden&#xED; verejn&#xFD;ch financi&#xED;, vr&#xE1;tane protikorup&#x10D;n&#xFD;ch t&#xE9;m.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
